  "operative_text": "Section 6216 (Family Code): For the purposes of this division, “firearm” includes the frame or receiver of the weapon and includes a precursor part. “Firearm precursor part” has the same meaning as in subdivision (a) of Section 16531 of the Penal Code. This section shall become operative on July 1, 2022.\nSection 16520 (Penal Code, added, operative July 1, 2022): (h) As used in Sections 18100 to 18205, inclusive, “firearm” includes a firearm precursor part. “Firearm precursor part” has the same meaning as in subdivision (a) of Section 16531."
}